<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Start Here: Tools for New Therapists | David Robles</title>
  <meta name="description" content="The practice-management and documentation tools David Robles, LMSW, actually uses to run a private therapy practice — an honest starting point for new and growing therapists." />
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://therapybydavid.com/start-here">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,400;1,9..144,500;1,9..144,600&display=swap" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
  <noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,400;1,9..144,500;1,9..144,600&display=swap"></noscript>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #080b10;
      --night: #101720;
      --navy: #142132;
      --champagne: #d8b866;
      --gold: #b99138;
      --cream: #f5efe3;
      --paper: #fbf8f1;
      --mist: #e8decc;
      --text: #15171b;
      --muted: #6a6258;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --line: rgba(216, 184, 102, .25);
      --shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
      --radius: 28px;
      --max: 1180px;
      --serif: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
      --sans: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: var(--sans);
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.65;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
    p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 68ch; }
    .container { max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
    .section { padding: 104px 0; }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: .18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 34px; height: 1px; background: currentColor; opacity: .6; }
    h1, h2, h3 { font-family: var(--serif); color: var(--night); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 80px); font-weight: 700; }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 58px); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    h3 { font-size: 25px; font-weight: 650; }
    .lead { font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 21px); color: rgba(255,255,255,.74); line-height: 1.7; }
    .section-lead { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; max-width: 64ch; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 54px;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .02em;
      transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, background .2s ease, border-color .2s ease;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-gold { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--champagne), var(--gold)); color: #16100a; box-shadow: 0 16px 38px rgba(185,145,56,.32); }

    /* Nav */
    .nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      background: rgba(8,11,16,.74);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }
    .nav-inner { height: 76px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .brand { display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1; color: var(--white); }
    .brand strong { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 25px; letter-spacing: -.02em; font-weight: 700; }
    .brand span { color: var(--champagne); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .22em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 8px; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; align-items: center; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a { color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--white); }
    .nav-toggle { display: none; background: transparent; border: 0; width: 42px; height: 42px; cursor: pointer; }
    .nav-toggle span { display: block; height: 2px; background: var(--white); margin: 7px; border-radius: 99px; }

    /* Page Hero */
    .page-hero {
      padding: 160px 0 110px;
      color: var(--white);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 55%, rgba(216,184,102,.16), transparent 42%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(8,11,16,.98) 0%, rgba(16,23,32,.95) 55%, rgba(8,11,16,.90) 100%);
      position: relative;
    }
    .page-hero::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; inset: auto 0 0 0; height: 120px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--paper));
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .page-hero h1 { color: var(--white); max-width: 860px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .page-hero .lead { margin-bottom: 0; max-width: 660px; }

    /* Curated tool rows */
    .tools-section { background: var(--cream); }
    .tool-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 48px;
      max-width: 980px;
    }
    .tool-row {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid rgba(216,184,102,.45);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 34px 40px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 230px 1fr;
      gap: 46px;
      align-items: center;
      transition: transform .22s ease, box-shadow .22s ease, border-color .22s ease;
    }
    .tool-row:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(20,33,50,.12);
      border-color: rgba(216,184,102,.7);
    }
    .tool-row-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; }
    .tool-row-logo { height: 32px; width: auto; max-width: 200px; object-fit: contain; align-self: flex-start; }
    .tool-row-logo.is-upheal { height: 46px; }
    .tool-row-wordmark { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; color: var(--night); line-height: 1; }
    .tool-row-compact { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 20px; padding: 28px 40px; }
    .tool-row-compact .tool-row-head { gap: 10px; }
    .tool-row-go { font-size: 24px; color: var(--gold); transition: transform .2s ease; }
    .tool-row-compact:hover .tool-row-go { transform: translateX(6px); }
    .tool-row-category { color: var(--gold); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .tool-row-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; }
    .tool-row-body p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 58ch; margin: 0; }
    .tool-row-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 13px 24px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .02em;
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--night);
      border: 1px solid var(--night);
      transition: transform .2s ease, background .2s ease;
    }
    .tool-row-link:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #1c2a3a; }

    /* Honest note */
    .honest { background: var(--paper); }
    .honest-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid rgba(216,184,102,.45);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 38px 42px;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(20,33,50,.06);
    }
    .honest-card h3 { font-size: 23px; color: var(--night); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .honest-card p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .honest-card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    /* Final / contact */
    .final-cta { background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); text-align: center; padding: 110px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .final-cta::before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 540px; height: 540px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(216,184,102,.14), transparent 68%); top: -220px; right: -160px; pointer-events: none; }
    .final-cta .container { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
    .final-cta h2 { color: var(--white); max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 22px; }
    .final-cta p { margin: 0 auto 36px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); font-size: 19px; max-width: 54ch; }

    /* Footer */
    footer { background: #000000; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); padding: 58px 0 38px; }
    .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    footer h3, footer h4 { color: var(--white); }
    footer h3 { font-size: 29px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    footer h4 { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .16em; margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--champagne); }
    footer ul { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 10px; }
    footer a { color: rgba(255,255,255,.68); }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--white); }
    .copyright { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); margin-top: 42px; padding-top: 24px; font-size: 13px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease; }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .nav-links { display: none; position: absolute; top: 76px; left: 0; right: 0; padding: 20px 24px 28px; background: rgba(8,11,16,.96); flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); }
      .nav-links.open { display: flex; }
      .nav-toggle { display: block; }
      .page-hero { padding-top: 130px; padding-bottom: 80px; }
      .tool-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; padding: 30px; }
      .tool-row-compact { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; padding: 24px 28px; }
      .tool-row-head { gap: 12px; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .section { padding: 78px 0; }
    }
  </style>
  <style id="nav-dd-styles">
  .nav-dd { position: relative; }
  .nav-dd > a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .nav-dd > a .caret { font-size: 9px; opacity: .7; transition: transform .2s ease; }
  .nav-dd:hover > a .caret, .nav-dd:focus-within > a .caret { transform: rotate(180deg); }
  .nav-dd-menu { position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 18px); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(8px); min-width: 268px; list-style: none; padding: 10px; background: rgba(8,11,16,.97); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); border-radius: 18px; backdrop-filter: blur(18px); box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.4); opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: opacity .2s ease, transform .2s ease; display: grid; gap: 2px; z-index: 60; }
  .nav-dd-menu::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -18px; left: 0; right: 0; height: 18px; }
  .nav-dd:hover .nav-dd-menu, .nav-dd:focus-within .nav-dd-menu { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
  .nav-dd-menu a { display: block; padding: 11px 14px; border-radius: 11px; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); white-space: nowrap; }
  .nav-dd-menu a:hover { background: rgba(216,184,102,.14); color: #fff; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .nav-dd { width: 100%; }
    .nav-dd-menu { position: static; opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: none; min-width: 0; padding: 8px 0 0 14px; background: transparent; border: 0; box-shadow: none; backdrop-filter: none; }
    .nav-dd:hover .nav-dd-menu, .nav-dd:focus-within .nav-dd-menu { transform: none; }
    .nav-dd-menu::before { display: none; }
    .nav-dd-menu a { padding: 8px 0; }
  }
  </style>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/images/favicon-32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/images/favicon-16.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/images/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#080b10">
  <script src="/analytics.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>

  {% include "nav.njk" %}

  <main>

    <!-- PAGE HERO -->
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">For New &amp; Growing Therapists</span>
        <h1>Start here: the tools I actually use to run my practice.</h1>
        <p class="lead">The platforms I actually use to run my practice — so you can skip the twelve-tab comparison spreadsheet and start where I'd tell a colleague to begin.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TOOLS -->
    <section class="section tools-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">My Core Stack</span>
          <h2>The tools that keep the back office handled.</h2>
          <p class="section-lead">Start with what removes the most friction today — you can always add more later.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-list">

          <!-- SimplePractice -->
          <article class="tool-row reveal">
            <div class="tool-row-head">
              <img class="tool-row-logo" src="/images/partners/simplepractice.png" alt="SimplePractice logo" loading="lazy">
              <span class="tool-row-category">Practice Management</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tool-row-body">
              <p>The all-in-one EHR most therapists start with. Scheduling, a secure client portal, paperless intakes, billing, superbills, telehealth, and HIPAA-compliant documentation — all under one roof. It's the system that makes a solo practice feel like it has a front desk.</p>
              <a class="tool-row-link" href="https://share.simplepractice.com/davidarobles!51c0efbbb8!a" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener nofollow">Try SimplePractice &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Upheal -->
          <article class="tool-row reveal">
            <div class="tool-row-head">
              <img class="tool-row-logo is-upheal" src="/images/partners/upheal.png" alt="Upheal logo" loading="lazy">
              <span class="tool-row-category">AI Progress Notes</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tool-row-body">
              <p>Documentation is where most therapists quietly burn out. Upheal transcribes your session and drafts the progress note for you — SOAP, DAP, EMDR, intake notes — so you review and sign instead of writing from scratch. HIPAA-compliant and built specifically for mental health clinicians.</p>
              <a class="tool-row-link" href="https://upheal.link/david-robles" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener nofollow">Try Upheal &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <!-- Reclaim.ai -->
          <article class="tool-row reveal">
            <div class="tool-row-head">
              <img class="tool-row-logo" src="/images/partners/reclaim.png" alt="Reclaim.ai logo" loading="lazy">
              <span class="tool-row-category">Smart Scheduling</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tool-row-body">
              <p>An AI calendar that defends your time. Reclaim auto-blocks your week for tasks, breaks, and admin, syncs all your calendars into one clean view, and guards the buffer between sessions so your day doesn't collapse into back-to-backs. If you're running multiple calendars, this is what keeps them from colliding.</p>
              <a class="tool-row-link" href="https://reclaim.ai/r/s/TRxs7" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener nofollow">Try Reclaim.ai &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </article>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- GET LISTED / DIRECTORIES -->
    <section class="section listed-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Get Found</span>
          <h2>Where to list your profile.</h2>
          <p class="section-lead">The tools above keep the practice running — a directory profile is how clients actually find you. This is where I'd start.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-list">

          <!-- Therapist.com -->
          <a class="tool-row tool-row-compact reveal" href="https://therapist.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="tool-row-head">
              <span class="tool-row-wordmark">Therapist.com</span>
              <span class="tool-row-category">Therapist Directory</span>
            </div>
            <span class="tool-row-go">&rarr;</span>
          </a>

          <!-- Open Path Collective -->
          <a class="tool-row tool-row-compact reveal" href="https://openpathcollective.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="tool-row-head">
              <span class="tool-row-wordmark">Open Path Collective</span>
              <span class="tool-row-category">Sliding-Scale Directory</span>
            </div>
            <span class="tool-row-go">&rarr;</span>
          </a>

          <!-- Mental Health Match -->
          <a class="tool-row tool-row-compact reveal" href="https://mentalhealthmatch.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="tool-row-head">
              <span class="tool-row-wordmark">Mental Health Match</span>
              <span class="tool-row-category">Client Matching</span>
            </div>
            <span class="tool-row-go">&rarr;</span>
          </a>

          <!-- Offline.now -->
          <a class="tool-row tool-row-compact reveal" href="https://offline.now/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="tool-row-head">
              <span class="tool-row-wordmark">Offline.now</span>
              <span class="tool-row-category">Digital Wellness Directory</span>
            </div>
            <span class="tool-row-go">&rarr;</span>
          </a>

          <!-- ThrivingCampus -->
          <a class="tool-row tool-row-compact reveal" href="https://thrivingcampus.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="tool-row-head">
              <span class="tool-row-wordmark">ThrivingCampus</span>
              <span class="tool-row-category">College Referrals</span>
            </div>
            <span class="tool-row-go">&rarr;</span>
          </a>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HONEST NOTE -->
    <section class="section honest">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="honest-card reveal">
          <h3>A straight word before you sign up for anything.</h3>
          <p>No tool replaces clinical judgment, supervision, or your own ethics. AI-assisted notes still need your review and your signature — you're responsible for what goes in the record, and for getting proper client consent before recording or transcribing a session. Check your state board and your malpractice carrier's guidance first.</p>
          <p>Pick what fits the practice you're actually building, not the one a sales page is selling you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CONTACT / CLOSE -->
    <section class="final-cta">
      <div class="container reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Building Your Practice?</span>
        <h2>Got a question about getting set up?</h2>
        <p>I'm a fellow clinician, not a salesperson. If you're figuring out your setup and want a second opinion, reach out — happy to point you in the right direction.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href="mailto:info@therapybydavid.com?subject=Question%20about%20getting%20started%20in%20practice">Email Me a Question</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  {% include "footer.njk" %}

  <script>
    const navToggle = document.getElementById('nav-toggle');
    const navLinks = document.getElementById('nav-links');
    if (navToggle && navLinks) {
      navToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const open = navLinks.classList.toggle('open');
        navToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
      });
      navLinks.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link => link.addEventListener('click', () => {
        navLinks.classList.remove('open');
        navToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
      }));
    }
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
      entries.forEach(entry => { if (entry.isIntersecting) entry.target.classList.add('visible'); });
    }, { threshold: .12 });
    document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
  </script>
</body>
</html>
